如臨邛，從昆弟假貸猶足為生，何至自苦如此！」相如與俱之臨邛，盡賣其車騎，買一酒舍酤酒，而令文君當爐。相如身自著犢鼻褌，與保庸雜作，滌器於市中。卓王孫聞而恥之，為杜門不出。昆弟諸公更謂王孫曰：「有一男兩女，所不足者非財也。今文君已失身於司馬長卿，長卿故倦遊，雖貧，其人材足依也，且又令客，獨奈何相辱如此！」卓王孫不得已，分予文君僮百人，錢百萬，及其嫁時衣被財物。文君乃與相如歸成都，買田宅，為富人。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m002-0001","start":1,"end":4,"surface":"梁孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m002-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"相如","kind":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m002-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"臨邛令","kind":"person","person_id":"3f2_lz0_sod","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m002-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"王吉","kind":"person","person_id":"3f2_lz0_sod","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m002-0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"吉","kind":"person","person_id":"3f2_lz0_sod","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m002-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"長卿","kind":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m002-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"相如","kind":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m002-0057","start":57,"end":60,"surface":"臨邛令","kind":"person","person_id":"3f2_lz0_sod","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m002-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"相如","kind":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m002-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"相如","kind":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m002-0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"吉","kind":"person","person_id":"3f2_lz0_sod","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m002-0088","start":88,"end":89,"surface":"吉"